class Solution {
    public int[] runningSum(int[] nums) {

        for (int i = 1; i<nums.length; i++) {
            nums[i] = nums[i] + nums[i-1];
            }
    return nums;


/*
Complexity Analysis:
Time Complexity: O(N)
Reason: A single linear loop traverses the array from index 1 to N - 1 once.
 
Space Complexity: O(1) Auxiliary Space
Reason: The solution mutates the input array in-place without allocating extra heap memory
